func main():
    -- Six columns: [abcdef] from 0, then g at 6, a tab at 7 and h at 8 on the second row. On the
    -- screen g is column 0, the tab runs to column 4 and h stands there; in the file's line g is
    -- column 6, the tab runs to 8 and h stands there.
