1 map is empty, row 0 column 0
2 map must be at least 3 columns by 3 rows, row 0 column 0
4 rows have different widths, row 2 column 5
5 empty rows are not allowed, row 2 column 1
6 unknown map symbol; use # . space or P, row 2 column 4
7 the outside edge must contain only # walls, row 1 column 3
8 map contains more than one P starting cell, row 2 column 3
9 map needs exactly one P starting cell, row 0 column 0
10 map needs at least one dot to collect, row 0 column 0
11 a dot cannot be reached from P, row 2 column 4
12 a carriage return must be followed by a newline, row 1 column 4
